    description: "Found by the 2026-11-07 docstring staleness audit (dev 4f2feb451b): a reviewer flagged it and a default-REJECT verifier re-reproduced it on a fixture of its own (reports under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/staleness_audit_11072026/review, verify and blind). Corpus impact not measured. in_tasks / in_handlers are set only from a play's tasks:/handlers: key (yaml_ansible.py:365-370) and names are read only under them (:395). roles/web/tasks/main.yml with two named tasks gives only a file symbol; most real Ansible tasks live in role files. r14, v05, b01."  # 9e4d
